Both are nice armor for beginning characters, as they are rustproof
and provide good protection.  However, the mithril-coat weighs only
a third as much as the crystal plate mail (150 vs. 450).  A quick
scan of the source code revealed nothing about mithril protecting
you from curses.  By the way, a related tip I just noticed: the elven
mithral coat weighs and costs exactly the same as the dwarven one, in
spite of providing less protection.  I always thought it was lighter,
until this check of the code.>
